<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-BOLAND 67-4 AT LUNCH VS EASTERN PROVINCE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BOLAND 67-4 AT LUNCH VS EASTERN PROVINCE.</headline>
<dateline>PAARL 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boland were 67 for four wickets at lunch on the third day of their Supersport Series match against Eastern Province in Paarl on Monday.</p>
<p>Boland first innings 204 and 67-4</p>
<p>Eastern Province 262</p>
